title: It is okay to not find answers
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

It's okay to not find ANSWERS, and to just keep creating vectors and pathways forward that are eternal exploration. That is something to be a human.

And about this wiki:

<<<
Part of bjornpaedia is that these are ideas and questions and places for others to be inspired or to take things further. I don't have to have all the answers, I can leave people with MORE questions (and myself! to be answered or just explored more in the future).
<<<

